usage: jaxwind [-h] {check,run,resume,workflow,case} ...

positional arguments:
  {check,run,resume,workflow,case}
    check               resolve and validate without constructing simulation
                        fields
    run                 start a simulation in an empty output directory
    resume              continue a new-format run
    workflow            execute declared stage dependencies

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
